{"4335450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GYROPIA", "steam_appid": 4335450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Gyropia?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True Co-op Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner fully control the vehicle together. While one player handles movement, the other maintains balance or operates mechanical systems. Communication is the only way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scars of the Catastrophe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive floating islands that defy gravity. Use your speed, jumping ability, and mid-air control to overcome challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysterious paths of this shattered world, solve platforming puzzles, and operate mechanisms hidden across the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op Experience:</strong> Team up with a friend online to conquer the fractured world of Gyropia. Every move requires a shared vision and perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Parkour:</strong> Use your Gyrosphere to navigate complex, gravity-defying islands. Master momentum and mid-air control to survive the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgiving Checkpoints:</strong> Don't let a single mistake ruin your run. Strategic checkpoints save your progress frequently, so you can jump right back into the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jump into your Gyrosphere and explore this fractured world together after the catastrophe!</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Gyropia?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True Co-op Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner fully control the vehicle together. While one player handles movement, the other maintains balance or operates mechanical systems. Communication is the only way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/d0173e44db4fb46361a0ea1382c0be9b.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scars of the Catastrophe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive floating islands that defy gravity. Use your speed, jumping ability, and mid-air control to overcome challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/e9e4b38986e79449384659d487c19439.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysterious paths of this shattered world, solve platforming puzzles, and operate mechanisms hidden across the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.poster.avif?t=1775682041\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.webm?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335450/extras/35cbec8a04ce0d071c6c992c54f50748.mp4?t=1775682041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op Experience:</strong> Team up with a friend online to conquer the fractured world of Gyropia. Every move requires a shared vision and perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Parkour:</strong> Use your Gyrosphere to navigate complex, gravity-defying islands. Master momentum and mid-air control to survive the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgiving Checkpoints:</strong> Don't let a single mistake ruin your run. Strategic checkpoints save your progress frequently, so you can jump right back into the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jump into your Gyrosphere and explore this fractured world together after the catastrophe!</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Explore the shattered floating islands after a great catastrophe and chart your path together with your partner! Share control of your Gyrosphere, overcome massive obstacles, and uncover the secrets of the sky. In Gyropia, survival depends on balance, speed, and teamwork.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Ita